<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>nagareteku jikan no naka ni</b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but the forgotten memories</b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:35,900
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Groundwater</font>

32
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:35,900
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Inexhaustible Ningu</font>

33
00:01:54,460 --> 00:01:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

34
00:02:00,890 --> 00:02:02,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

35
00:02:07,770 --> 00:02:09,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've come back, Choji!</font>

36
00:02:12,860 --> 00:02:14,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay, Naruto!</font>

37
00:02:14,570 --> 00:02:18,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm okay, but I'm not okay
with your heavy weight!</font>

38
00:02:19,030 --> 00:02:20,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll get him right away!</font>

39
00:02:24,410 --> 00:02:26,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it, Choji!
It doesn't work on him!</font>

40
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:32,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

41
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:41,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This water absorbs all the shocks and
it gives me an iron-wall defense.</font>

42
00:02:41,470 --> 00:02:42,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, really?</font>

43
00:02:44,930 --> 00:02:45,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shoot!</font>

44
00:02:47,060 --> 00:02:48,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Flower Ninja Art: Bloom!
Myriad of Flowers!</font>

45
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I'm saved.
— Where did that guy go?!</font>

46
00:03:08,660 --> 00:03:11,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After a bonfire, you should put it out.</font>

47
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:36,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is a limit to your Kunai knife,</font>

48
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:39,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but my water that the earth
gives me is infinite.</font>

49
00:03:40,030 --> 00:03:44,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His ninjutsu is endless.
So for now...</font>

50
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:44,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wanna run away?</font>

51
00:03:44,910 --> 00:03:47,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say that you'll withdraw!</font>

52
00:03:55,290 --> 00:03:56,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't get away.</font>

53
00:04:00,210 --> 00:04:01,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

54
00:04:04,050 --> 00:04:04,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After them!</font>

55
00:04:26,530 --> 00:04:27,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This way!</font>

56
00:04:29,410 --> 00:04:32,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you get caught by that water,
it's over for sure!</font>

57
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:34,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's coming around from
this side too.</font>

58
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:36,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's trying to trap us!</font>

59
00:04:39,380 --> 00:04:43,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Run! Run! You're all going to
get eaten if you get caught!</font>

60
00:04:45,220 --> 00:04:46,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate, we're eventually
going to be defeated.</font>

61
00:04:46,930 --> 00:04:49,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like we've gotta beat him up,
after all.</font>

62
00:04:49,930 --> 00:04:51,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But how are we going to beat him</font>

63
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:53,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if the attack doesn't work on him?</font>

64
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

65
00:05:12,500 --> 00:05:14,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you think
there's something weird about him?</font>

66
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:22,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is?</font>

67
00:05:22,420 --> 00:05:23,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder?</font>

68
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:25,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be joking at a time like this!</font>

69
00:05:26,130 --> 00:05:30,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps, is Naruto talking
about his tonfa?</font>

70
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:34,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh yeah, he's holding his tonfa
like a dowsing rod.</font>

71
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:35,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it!</font>

72
00:05:35,980 --> 00:05:37,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's called dousing.</font>

73
00:05:37,850 --> 00:05:39,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you concentrate on the item
you're looking for,</font>

74
00:05:39,980 --> 00:05:44,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it will react to that item and inform you
when you get near it.</font>

75
00:05:44,530 --> 00:05:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dowsing?</font>

76
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:48,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see! Naruto, Choji!</font>

77
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:51,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We might have a chance to win!</font>

78
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:55,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that tonfa is the secret of
this jutsu, then...</font>

79
00:05:56,960 --> 00:05:57,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

80
00:05:58,750 --> 00:06:01,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's wrap up the chase!</font>

81
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:03,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

82
00:06:06,090 --> 00:06:06,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot.</font>

83
00:06:10,930 --> 00:06:12,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not going to let you get away!</font>

84
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:22,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got you!</font>

85
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:40,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seems like you tried to get close to me,
but too bad</font>

86
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:42,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

87
00:06:50,300 --> 00:06:53,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to prepare
a special one for you.</font>

88
00:06:58,060 --> 00:06:59,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What Naruto?</font>

89
00:06:59,850 --> 00:07:01,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and run, Choji!</font>

90
00:07:28,630 --> 00:07:29,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yurinojou!</font>

91
00:07:33,550 --> 00:07:35,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yurinojou! Choji!</font>

92
00:07:38,270 --> 00:07:39,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji!</font>

93
00:07:48,230 --> 00:07:49,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Behind you! Look behind you!</font>

94
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:54,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said look behind you!</font>

95
00:08:00,910 --> 00:08:01,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji!</font>

96
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:10,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji!</font>

97
00:08:27,230 --> 00:08:28,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fight is over.</font>

98
00:08:29,190 --> 00:08:32,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, the big one,
I'll eat you first.</font>

99
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:34,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Certainly the fight is over.</font>

100
00:08:34,610 --> 00:08:36,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A fight where you're going to lose.</font>

101
00:08:37,030 --> 00:08:37,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

102
00:08:37,990 --> 00:08:41,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now, Choji!
Drink up the water!</font>

103
00:08:54,130 --> 00:08:55,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Useless, useless.</font>

104
00:08:55,630 --> 00:08:58,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water will gush out from the ground
with no limits.</font>

105
00:09:00,810 --> 00:09:01,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why isn't the water coming out?</font>

106
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:07,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I said, it's useless.</font>

107
00:09:07,860 --> 00:09:08,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?!</font>

108
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:12,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The water that will protect
you will not come out of here.</font>

109
00:09:13,110 --> 00:09:14,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look carefully at the surroundings..</font>

110
00:09:16,610 --> 00:09:19,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, water does not come out
of this craggy place.</font>

111
00:09:26,250 --> 00:09:27,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm full!</font>

112
00:09:33,050 --> 00:09:36,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yurinojou has realized your secret.</font>

113
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:40,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I also thought something was strange.</font>

114
00:09:41,470 --> 00:09:43,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I went to check the trap,</font>

115
00:09:43,560 --> 00:09:47,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I decided to take the shortest route
through the craggy area.</font>

116
00:09:48,310 --> 00:09:52,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It wouldn't have been strange
to run into you there,</font>

117
00:09:52,230 --> 00:09:53,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but that didn't happen.</font>

118
00:09:54,190 --> 00:09:55,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The answer to that is easy!</font>

119
00:09:56,820 --> 00:09:58,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You made a detour because
you avoided craggy areas</font>

120
00:09:59,030 --> 00:10:00,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where the water wouldn't come out.</font>

121
00:10:01,330 --> 00:10:03,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The tonfa you hold is a weapon</font>

122
00:10:03,740 --> 00:10:06,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and was a way to find the water
through dowsing.</font>

123
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:11,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You lost them and you went away
from your advantageous places.</font>

124
00:10:11,460 --> 00:10:14,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mean... The reason why
you cracked my tonfa was...</font>

125
00:10:15,340 --> 00:10:17,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, it wasn't a coincidence.</font>

126
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:22,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was planned by Yurinojou who
calculated your actions.</font>

127
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:24,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

128
00:10:24,430 --> 00:10:27,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This one will be heavy because
of the water!</font>

129
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:32,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Human Boulder!</font>

130
00:10:52,630 --> 00:10:54,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did it! Choji!</font>

131
00:10:58,470 --> 00:10:59,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yurinojou!</font>

132
00:11:00,010 --> 00:11:04,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My ribs are injured,
but I'm okay.</font>

133
00:11:05,060 --> 00:11:08,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there should be three of them,
so hurry and get the princess!</font>

134
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:10,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got it!</font>

135
00:11:10,980 --> 00:11:13,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji, please take care of Yurinojou.</font>

136
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

137
00:11:14,060 --> 00:11:16,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll catch up to Hinata!</font>

138
00:11:22,950 --> 00:11:24,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me rest a little.</font>

139
00:11:25,990 --> 00:11:26,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got it.</font>

140
00:11:27,540 --> 00:11:29,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's wait for everyone here.</font>

141
00:11:36,130 --> 00:11:37,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need to wait.</font>

142
00:11:38,340 --> 00:11:42,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After we rest a little, you are going
to take me to a safe place.</font>

143
00:11:42,890 --> 00:11:44,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Naruto and the others are not yet...</font>

144
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:46,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That doesn't matter!</font>

145
00:11:46,850 --> 00:11:49,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the first place, everything became
like this because of you guys.</font>

146
00:11:49,930 --> 00:11:51,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Instead of taking the long way,</font>

147
00:11:51,270 --> 00:11:54,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if we had used the merchant people
as decoys,</font>

148
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:57,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then we would have escaped by now!</font>

149
00:11:57,400 --> 00:12:00,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Decoys?
But Kikusuke has already...</font>

150
00:12:00,820 --> 00:12:01,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about it?</font>

151
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:07,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If your mission as ninja is to risk
your life in the line of duty,</font>

152
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:08,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then Kikunojou should be satisfied.</font>

153
00:12:09,620 --> 00:12:11,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though Kikunojou is dead,</font>

154
00:12:11,160 --> 00:12:14,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if I am still alive, then it's possible to
revive the Land of the Green.</font>

155
00:12:14,710 --> 00:12:15,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Princess.</font>

156
00:12:15,460 --> 00:12:22,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata, you won't understand how
I was separated from my parents</font>

157
00:12:22,260 --> 00:12:24,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to be held as hostage in
a foreign country</font>

158
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:27,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and how much I was bullied.</font>

159
00:12:28,470 --> 00:12:34,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I realized then that only fools would
expect to live off of human compassion.</font>

160
00:12:35,190 --> 00:12:36,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Especially someone like Naruto</font>

161
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:38,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who is easily influenced by
people's emotions</font>

162
00:12:39,020 --> 00:12:40,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">should be disqualified as a ninja.</font>

163
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:43,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He loses his rationality in his goal.</font>

164
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:47,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Princess, what do you know
about Naruto?</font>

165
00:12:48,660 --> 00:12:51,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto has lived without his parents
since he was a child.</font>

166
00:12:52,830 --> 00:12:54,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has always lived alone.</font>

167
00:12:55,540 --> 00:12:58,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be accepted by everyone,
to become the next Hokage...</font>

168
00:12:58,960 --> 00:13:01,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he has worked hard... really hard...</font>

169
00:13:02,010 --> 00:13:03,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Despite all that, he didn't give up</font>

170
00:13:03,800 --> 00:13:08,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and he would never think of
living at the expense of others.</font>

171
00:13:09,220 --> 00:13:11,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He tried and tried.</font>

172
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:13,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto and I are in different positions.</font>

173
00:13:15,810 --> 00:13:18,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry. You're right, Princess.</font>

174
00:13:21,190 --> 00:13:24,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata, do you like Naruto?</font>

175
00:13:27,820 --> 00:13:28,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand.</font>

176
00:13:29,490 --> 00:13:30,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's wait for everyone here.</font>

177
00:13:31,450 --> 00:13:32,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Princess...</font>

178
00:13:32,950 --> 00:13:34,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That bag must be heavy.</font>

179
00:13:34,660 --> 00:13:35,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will relieve you
of some of the burden.</font>

180
00:13:35,750 --> 00:13:37,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, thanks.</font>

181
00:13:44,630 --> 00:13:48,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I cannot die in a place like this.</font>

182
00:13:59,150 --> 00:14:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you look nice, Ruiga.</font>

183
00:14:01,690 --> 00:14:05,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiga... Help me... Brother...</font>

184
00:14:06,570 --> 00:14:07,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever.</font>

185
00:14:08,570 --> 00:14:14,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you die, Brother Renga and I could
split the Land of Green's profits.</font>

186
00:14:14,910 --> 00:14:15,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiga...</font>

187
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:17,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't blame me.</font>

188
00:14:17,580 --> 00:14:19,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

189
00:14:24,630 --> 00:14:28,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop Jiga...!</font>

190
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:56,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

191
00:15:00,460 --> 00:15:01,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata.</font>

192
00:15:05,250 --> 00:15:06,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

193
00:15:10,130 --> 00:15:11,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is the Princess?</font>

194
00:15:11,550 --> 00:15:13,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I was going to ask!</font>

195
00:15:13,890 --> 00:15:17,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said let's wait here and the minute
I turned around...</font>

196
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:20,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why does a ninja like you
get beaten by an amateur?</font>

197
00:15:22,980 --> 00:15:24,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry.</font>

198
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then right now she should be alone...</font>

199
00:15:27,690 --> 00:15:30,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, we should first go back
to the village</font>

200
00:15:30,740 --> 00:15:32,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and get advice from the Hokage.</font>

201
00:15:32,700 --> 00:15:35,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! There's no time for that.</font>

202
00:15:35,910 --> 00:15:38,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are still two Janin left.</font>

203
00:15:39,330 --> 00:15:42,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She'll get killed if she gets caught.</font>

204
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:45,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But this really isn't an official mission.</font>

205
00:15:46,130 --> 00:15:49,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We might not be able to
handle the other two...</font>

206
00:15:50,220 --> 00:15:50,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right.</font>

207
00:15:52,430 --> 00:15:56,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you say, this may not be
an official mission but...</font>

208
00:15:58,020 --> 00:16:03,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">she's trying really hard to escape
by herself right now.</font>

209
00:16:03,900 --> 00:16:07,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The things she says and does
may be wrong,</font>

210
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but somehow,
I can't leave her alone.</font>

211
00:16:12,110 --> 00:16:13,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, I'll also...</font>

212
00:16:13,740 --> 00:16:14,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

213
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:17,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yurinojou got hurt.</font>

214
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:21,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You and Choji,
please take care of Yurinojou!</font>

215
00:16:22,830 --> 00:16:23,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you later!</font>

216
00:16:26,750 --> 00:16:28,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful, Naruto.</font>

217
00:16:42,390 --> 00:16:43,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right there!</font>

218
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:48,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, you have good instincts.</font>

219
00:16:49,110 --> 00:16:51,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll praise you for getting Ruiga.</font>

220
00:16:56,530 --> 00:16:58,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you the second Janin?</font>

221
00:16:59,030 --> 00:17:04,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I feel honoured that you know
about me.</font>

222
00:17:04,580 --> 00:17:07,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you should brag about it
in the other world.</font>

223
00:17:07,540 --> 00:17:10,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Mr. Jiga killed you,
so it couldn't be helped.</font>

224
00:17:16,300 --> 00:17:17,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu.</font>

225
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:24,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

226
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:27,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That wouldn't work.</font>

227
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:32,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...</font>

228
00:17:32,650 --> 00:17:34,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind of ninjutsu is he using?</font>

229
00:17:38,320 --> 00:17:41,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Hidden Leaf Ninja, huh?
How interesting.</font>

230
00:17:41,660 --> 00:17:44,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll put them down as
one of my next targets.</font>

231
00:17:47,330 --> 00:17:49,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you do that!</font>

232
00:17:52,460 --> 00:17:53,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How did...?</font>

233
00:17:59,180 --> 00:18:00,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup.</font>

234
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:03,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My Ninjutsu is Ninja Art Magnet.</font>

235
00:18:14,860 --> 00:18:15,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's like this!</font>

236
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:44,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will live, no matter what...</font>

237
00:18:55,530 --> 00:18:57,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is your graveyard.</font>

238
00:18:58,610 --> 00:19:01,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will return those words
right back at you.</font>

239
00:19:04,790 --> 00:19:06,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!
Then.</font>

240
00:19:07,580 --> 00:19:08,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!</font>

241
00:19:13,840 --> 00:19:16,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! What's going on?!</font>

242
00:19:22,550 --> 00:19:25,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I do?
I can't find Choji.</font>

243
00:19:25,970 --> 00:19:30,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure that he's somewhere
hiding his presence, but...</font>

244
00:19:39,150 --> 00:19:41,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is Naruto's forehead band.</font>

245
00:19:45,910 --> 00:19:47,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

246
00:19:48,870 --> 00:19:51,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I grew up drinking iron.</font>

247
00:19:52,710 --> 00:19:55,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I can use the iron</font>

248
00:19:55,790 --> 00:19:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that has accumulated in my body
and turn myself into a magnet.</font>

249
00:19:59,840 --> 00:20:03,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This rocky mountain contains
lots of iron,</font>

250
00:20:03,090 --> 00:20:05,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">making it my invincible battlefield.</font>

251
00:20:06,430 --> 00:20:08,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Change yourself into a magnet...?</font>

252
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:13,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, I could also change
the things I touch into magnets.</font>

253
00:20:13,350 --> 00:20:17,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've already changed the rocks behind you
into powerful magnets.</font>

254
00:20:19,650 --> 00:20:21,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what are you trying to do?!</font>

255
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:26,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean this!
Ninja Art Magnet: Infinite Meteors!</font>

256
00:20:29,330 --> 00:20:31,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Second hit! Third hit!</font>

257
00:20:35,420 --> 00:20:36,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

258
00:20:39,250 --> 00:20:43,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your friend... I'll take good care of her.</font>

259
00:20:48,430 --> 00:20:50,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata! Don't come!</font>

260
00:20:52,060 --> 00:20:52,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is...</font>

261
00:20:54,350 --> 00:20:58,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is... a dangerous... opponent...</font>

262
00:21:02,990 --> 00:21:04,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

