291
00:22:38,750 --> 00:22:39,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What should I do?</font>

292
00:22:39,830 --> 00:22:42,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">My Gentle Fist won't work against
his Ninja Art.</font>

293
00:22:43,090 --> 00:22:46,090
